      "writtenOn": "2019-02-05T19:05:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t really like this interface. Alternatives:\n\n* Pass an explicit null to unset. (Except maybe we can\u0027t distinguish these cases in Gson?)\n* Treat \"\" and unset as the same in the backend, so passing \"\" unsets the value and causes it to not be returned.",
      "revId": "41c135497c159f450c159ab3f7902eda817c3c0e",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153",
